Package: termux-dex
Version: 1.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tanmay-1122 <https://github.com/Tanmay-1122>
Depends: bash
Description: Termux Desktop - lightweight installer and launcher for Android
 Installs the termux-dex setup and desktop launcher scripts without forcing
 a large desktop download during package installation.
 .
 v1.5 update: extracted shared lib.sh, GTK CSS template, added uninstall
 script, SHA-256 integrity verification, unified VERSION numbering,
 auto-install missing xrdp in RDP mode, CI fixes, ASCII-only output.
 .
 v1.2 fixes: missing apt Release file, shell-killing pgrep bug, set -e
 footgun in install.sh, termux-x11-nightly step ordering, ifconfig
 replaced with ip command on all scripts, arch guard for armv7 devices,
 storage pre-flight check, cache-aware pkg update in manage-apps.sh.
 .
 Run setup.sh after install to fetch the desktop packages you actually want:
 minimal for a fast Termux:X11 setup, standard for useful tools, or full for
 the larger app catalogue.
 .
 Homepage: https://github.com/Tanmay-1122/Termux-desktop
